abstract: The Hakai Institute maintains a weather station on located on Quadra Island
  near Hyacinthe Bay. The weather station measures the air temperature, wind speed
  and direction, humidity, atmospheric pressure, UV radiation, solar radiation, PAR,
  and precipitation since July 2012.
